*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Q residue library file for OPLS-AA/M 2015
* Parameters extracted: from OPLS-AA/M Parameter file, OPLSA-AA/M Topology file
* (https://zarbi.chem.yale.edu/oplsaam.html)
*
* A description of the parametrization procedure can be found in the following citation:
*   Robertson, M. J.; Tirado-Rives, J.; Jorgensen, W. L. 
*   Improved Peptide and Protein Torsional Energetics with the OPLS-AA Force Field. 
*   J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2015, 11 (7), 3499-3509
*   doi:10.1021/acs.jctc.5b00356.
*
* Manually curated at Åqvist lab (Lucien Koenekoop, 2025) 
*
* Name convention on basic and acidic a.a.:
* ARG, ARN, HIP, HID, HIE, LYS, LYN, ASP, ASH, GLU, GLH
*  +1    0   +1    0    0   +1    0   -1    0   -1    0
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{ALA} !            charge  0.0   ! Alanine     
    [atoms] ! name  type  charge !
        1     N     N238  -0.500 !     |         
        2     H     H241   0.300 !   H-N         
        3     CA    C224   0.140 !     |     HB1 
        4     HA    H140   0.060 !     |    /    
        5     CB    C135  -0.180 !  HA-CA--CB-HB2
        6     HB1   H140   0.060 !     |    \    
        7     HB2   H140   0.060 !     |     HB3 
        8     HB3   H140   0.060 !   O=C         
        9     C     C235   0.500 !     |         
        10    O     O236  -0.500 !
    [bonds]
        CB    CA    
        N     H     
        N     CA    
        C     CA    
        CA    HA    
        CB    HB1   
        CB    HB2   
        CB    HB3   
        O     C     
    [connections]
        head  N     
        tail  C     
    [impropers]
        H     N     -C    CA    
        O     C     CA    +N    
    [charge_groups]
        N     H     CA    HA    
        CB    HB1   HB2   HB3   
        C     O     
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
